 ## Evidence572 — Digest-pinned current review for retained V4 handoffs
 
 The physical V4 release CLI accepts independently digest-pinned review inputs through `--current-review` and `--current-review-sha256`. The healthy fixture attaches the exact saved handoff. Revocation refuses both the closure and its attachment. Proof eligibility remains pending. A fresh Source42 read and ordinary pytest run on the reconciled candidate at cbc43a5f with Accelerate at 219ba3da passed all 33 cases across 15 functions. The run covered 22 retained coordinator cases, four retained handoff cases, and seven CLI cases. The separate private suite improved from eight passes and seven failures to 15 passes. The earlier isolated run remains historical evidence. Statutory admission, Native and model qualification, and authentication of the clock and registry freshness remain outside this evidence. [Current ordinary qualification](/tmp/Root-V4-CLI-live-main-reconcile-EsXXzUG0/actual-live-reconciled-V4-CLI-ordinary33-closed.json) · [Earlier isolated qualification](/tmp/P2-V4-CLI-ordinary33-isolated-Guide571-LzSFO07f/actual-isolated-V4-CLI-ordinary33-closed.json) · [Separate private same15](/tmp/P2-physical-V4-retained-handoff-current-trust-CLI-private-cy1j1i4x/SEALED-current-V4-CLI-current-review-retained-handoff-exact-two-private.json)
